{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d07402492ca9ef05","name":"Low-Hanging Branches","source":{"id":"source:reference-d07402492ca9ef05","title":"Low-Hanging Branches","revision":21370,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:40:34Z","sha256":"7a9ddc2a17de804bbc4c5c82d6f1cc9c346d297e25ae5bb3a8ada954a62b24bd","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21370","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Low-Hanging%20Branches&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d07402492ca9ef05","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["A number of branches covered in jagged razorvine hang down in your path, making it difficult to maneuver past them safely."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Running into branches while traveling through a forest or jungle is never pleasant, especially when moving at high velocity on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder Bike"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder_Bike"}," or a mount. Although Low-Hanging Branches cause problems on their own- especially those covered with sharp vines- some beings find ways to use the limbs as makeshift weapons, pulling them back and releasing them as opponents run or ride past. Clever manipulators also use Low-Hanging Branches to divert their foes toward another trap planted along a path that looks more appealing.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Low-Hanging Branches Statistics (CL 2)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Keywords:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Natural"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Natural"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Trigger:"]}," A being enters a square in containing Low-Hanging Branches.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Attack:"]}," +4 vs ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 2d10\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Recurrence:"]}," On Trigger\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},":"]}," The following are suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," for this Hazard:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," (DC 14):"]}," The character detects the Low-Hanging Branches as they approach, gaining a +5 bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," to avoid them."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," For targets riding on a creature or in a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," that does not provide ",{"tag":"a","children":["Total Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Total_Cover"},", the Hazard's damage is 2d10x2.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
